&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Product Manager - Categories (h/f/x)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Localisation :&lt;/strong&gt; Paris, France&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Domaine :&lt;/strong&gt; E-Commerce Solutions — Navigate &amp;amp; Categories&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;À PROPOS DE DECATHLON &amp;amp; DU DOMAINE E-COMMERCE&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Decathlon accélère sa transformation digitale avec pour mission de devenir &lt;strong&gt;la plateforme digitale du sport&lt;/strong&gt; qui permet à nos clients de découvrir notre univers à travers des expériences locales, axées sur le sport et omnicanales.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Notre Mission :&lt;/strong&gt; Faire bouger les gens à travers le sport pour rendre le bien-être accessible à tous.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;En rejoignant ce périmètre, vous travaillerez au sein du domaine &lt;strong&gt;E-Commerce Solutions&lt;/strong&gt;. Nos équipes transforment et déploient la navigation e-commerce mondiale, les arborescences de catalogue ainsi que les moteurs de catégorisation back-end visant à faciliter la découverte et l&#39;accès à la totalité de l&#39;offre Decathlon (produits, services et informations).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;REJOIGNEZ LA SQUAD CATEGORIES&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Rattaché(e) au &lt;strong&gt;Group Product Manager (E-Commerce / Navigate)&lt;/strong&gt;, vous prendrez la responsabilité de la squad &lt;strong&gt;Categories&lt;/strong&gt;. Vous travaillerez aux côtés d&#39;une équipe d&#39;ingénierie dédiée (Tech Lead, Senior Software Engineers) et en étroite collaboration avec les UX Researchers, Product Designers, Data Analysts, Sports Digital Merchandisers ainsi que les équipes E-Commerce locales des différents pays.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Vision Produit :&lt;/strong&gt; Favoriser la découverte grâce à une navigation intelligente et évolutive. Nous construisons un parcours de navigation intuitif, automatisé et personnalisé pour permettre à chaque client de trouver plus rapidement ce dont il a besoin et ce qu&#39;il désire.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Objectif Cible :&lt;/strong&gt; Stimuler la conversion globale et générer du chiffre d&#39;affaires incrémental en transformant des arborescences locales fragmentées en une &lt;strong&gt;Core Navigation&lt;/strong&gt; unifiée et performante sur le web et le mobile.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;VOS MISSIONS&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Vision &amp;amp; Stratégie Produit&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Définir la vision produit, la stratégie et la roadmap pour l&#39;écosystème &lt;strong&gt;Categories &amp;amp; Core Navigation&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Piloter et arbitrer les chantiers clés du produit : &lt;strong&gt;Core Navigation&lt;/strong&gt; (standardisation des arborescences au niveau mondial) et les &lt;strong&gt;Moteurs de catégorisation au niveau SKU&lt;/strong&gt; (comme notre moteur de streaming &lt;em&gt;Tesseract&lt;/em&gt;).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Aligner les parties prenantes (équipes sports centrales, merchandising digital global, équipes pays) autour de modèles opérationnels partagés.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Discovery &amp;amp; Gouvernance&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identifier en continu les opportunités utilisateurs, SEO et business via l&#39;analyse de données, des tests utilisateurs et des études de card-sorting.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Etablir un processus continue et consistant d&#39;AB test permettant d’affiner les convictions business et identifier les meilleurs opportunité de croissance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Concilier la standardisation globale avec la flexibilité nécessaire aux marchés locaux, en assurant la migration fluide des arborescences locales vers les &lt;strong&gt;Core Trees&lt;/strong&gt; globaux.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Établir des cadres de décision et des SLA clairs pour la taxonomie globale, la gouvernance SEO et la création de catégories.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Delivery &amp;amp; Alignement Technique&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Piloter le delivery agile en partenariat étroit avec le Tech Lead et les développeurs de la squad.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prioriser et affiner le backlog (epics, user stories) pour soutenir les flux d&#39;exportation multi-niveaux, les outils d&#39;orchestration de batchs et l&#39;exécution des règles taxonomiques.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Superviser les jalons clés de migration pour les pays adoptant le framework Core Navigation sur desktop et mobile.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Data &amp;amp; Performance&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Définir et suivre les métriques de succès de la navigation, notamment le &lt;strong&gt;PDP Reach Rate, le Revenu par Session, le CTR d&#39;utilisation du Menu&lt;/strong&gt; et la &lt;strong&gt;Conversion par Catégorie&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exploiter l&#39;analyse de données pour optimiser la performance des catégories, éliminer les catégories inactives et rationaliser les filtres taxonomiques.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Agencer et prioriser le backlog en s’appuyant sur de la data claire et fiable&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Culture &amp;amp; Mindset Produit&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Incarner un rôle d&#39;ambassadeur de l&#39;excellence produit et des standards de taxonomie au sein du réseau international de Decathlon.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Favoriser un environnement de travail collaboratif fondé sur la confiance, la responsabilité et la centricité utilisateur.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;PROFIL RECHERCHÉ&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Expérience :&lt;/strong&gt; 3 à 5+ ans d&#39;expérience en tant que Product Manager dans un environnement B2C e-commerce, plateforme digitale ou écosystème catalogue/recherche.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Expertise Domaine :&lt;/strong&gt; Excellente compréhension de la navigation e-commerce, des arborescences de catalogue, des structures de taxonomie/données ou des plateformes de search &amp;amp; discovery.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Gestion des parties prenantes :&lt;/strong&gt; Capacité avérée à naviguer et aligner des organisations internationales complexes et multi-métiers (équipes tech, merchandisers, responsables e-commerce pays).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Méthodologie Produit :&lt;/strong&gt; Maîtrise du cycle de développement produit de bout en bout — de la discovery (UX research, data, A/B testing) au delivery (refinement du backlog, roadmap technique, déploiement).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Esprit Analytique :&lt;/strong&gt; Approche orientée data pour prioriser les fonctionnalités et mesurer l&#39;impact sur la conversion et l&#39;expérience utilisateur.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Langues &amp;amp; Communication :&lt;/strong&gt; Maîtrise courante de l&#39;anglais et du français (oral et écrit), avec d&#39;excellentes capacités de synthèse.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Passion :&lt;/strong&gt; Curiosité pour la résolution de problèmes d&#39;architecture/données à grande échelle, la conception centrée utilisateur et une passion affirmée pour le sport !&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;CE QUE NOUS OFFRONS&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Télétravail flexible :&lt;/strong&gt; 2 jours de télétravail par semaine.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Lieu de travail :&lt;/strong&gt; Basé dans nos locaux Decathlon Digital à Paris, France.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Équipement au choix :&lt;/strong&gt; Travaillez sur votre équipement préféré (Mac, Windows, Chromebook).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Impact &amp;amp; Évolution :&lt;/strong&gt; Rôle à fort impact au cœur du moteur e-commerce global de Decathlon, offrant du mentorat, des certifications et des opportunités de carrière internationales.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Avantages Financiers :&lt;/strong&gt; Actionnariat salarié, primes mensuelles et trimestrielles.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;DECATHLON DIGITAL&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Imaginez si la technologie nous permettait de repousser les frontières et d&#39;offrir des expériences sportives inédites. C&#39;est précisément notre ambition chez Decathlon Digital ! Nous sommes une équipe de plus de 5 000 experts en ingénierie logicielle, gestion de produits, données, cloud et cybersécurité, répartis à Paris, Lille et Amsterdam. Ensemble, nous créons la plus vaste plateforme sportive numérique, en exploitant les innovations technologiques pour optimiser la chaîne de valeur, concevoir des expériences connectées et donner une seconde vie à nos produits.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Changeons la donne pour de bon.&lt;/strong&gt; Notre passion du sport nous guide et nous voulons qu’elle perdure. C’est pourquoi nous nous engageons à bâtir un modèle technologique plus durable, en réduisant notre impact direct sur l&#39;environnement, et en créant un espace sûr et inclusif pour apprendre et nous épanouir ensemble. Rejoins l’équipe et façonnons le futur du sport.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.fr/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in France</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who We Are &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Verve has created a more efficient and privacy-focused way to buy and monetize advertising. Verve is an ecosystem of demand and supply technologies fusing data, media, and technology together to deliver results and growth to both advertisers and publishers–no matter the screen or location, no matter who, what, or where a customer is. With 30 offices across the globe and with an eye on servicing forward-thinking advertising customers, Verve’s solutions are trusted by more than 90 of the United States’ top 100 advertisers, 4,000 publishers globally, and the world’s top demand-side platforms. Learn more at&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://verve.com/&quot;&gt;verve.com&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2&gt;About Verve Retail Media&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;isSelectedEnd&quot;&gt;The biggest challenge for advertisers in physical retail is the lack of measurable proof of effectiveness. Brands invest millions in advertising at the point of sale, but they cannot demonstrate whether those investments actually generated purchases.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;isSelectedEnd&quot;&gt;Verve Retail Media (VRM) solves this problem. We market and operate digital advertising screens across several thousand grocery, drugstore and convenience store locations, connecting them with digital coupons and retargeting campaigns on connected TV (CTV) and other offsite channels.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;isSelectedEnd&quot;&gt;Brands don’t book isolated advertising formats; instead, they book 360-degree campaigns that start at home and continue all the way through to an in-store purchase. This enables closed-loop measurement based on actual point-of-sale transaction data.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;VRM is the independent retail media division of publicly listed Verve Group SE. We operate like a rapidly scaling startup, with an AI-first strategy across all functions. We also have access to the infrastructure of an international ad tech company that delivers more than one trillion advertising impressions per year.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;AI needs data. While the digital world has been mapped, the vast, untapped data of human behavior and location intelligence remains the greatest challenge and the greatest opportunity. We are creating a robust data platform and sophisticated geo-targeting infrastructure that enables brands to understand shopper behavior and reach audiences effectively outside the physical store.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In order to build this platform, we are looking for a visionary Technical Product Manager to lead the development of our cutting-edge capabilities. In this role, you will sit at the intersection of AdTech, Location Data, and AI, building the infrastructure that allows brands and retailers to engage shoppers through off-site media and precise geographic targeting.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will own the roadmap for our core data platform, advanced geo-targeting tools, and off-site ad integrations. &lt;strong&gt;Crucially, you will own the entire product lifecycle from initial discovery and scoping all the way through to commercial readiness. This end-to-end ownership requires tight collaboration with our Sales and Operations teams to ensure what we build is not only technically sound but also highly marketable and operationally scalable.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;A critical focus of this role will be building products that scale globally, with a specific emphasis on spearheading our rollout and expansion into the US market. Your goal is to turn complex location and behavioral data into intelligent, monetizable media channels that drive measurable results.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Join a collaborative team of PMs dedicated to the holistic success of our Retail Media Platform. You won&#39;t build in a silo; you&#39;ll ensure a cohesive, unified roadmap across our data infrastructure and off-site touchpoints, driving a revolution in retail technology on a global scale.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;Product Strategy, Lifecycle Ownership &amp;amp; Global Roadmap&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the end-to-end product development process from discovery and ideation to commercial launch and operational readiness.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define and execute the product roadmap for our data platform, geo-targeting tools, and off-site media capabilities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Spearhead product localization and scaling efforts for international expansion, with a primary focus on the US market rollout. Ensure compliance with regional data privacy regulations (e.g., CCPA, GDPR).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Translate business goals into technical specifications, working closely with Sales to validate market fit and with Operations to ensure seamless delivery and support post-launch.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Data Platform &amp;amp; Geo-Targeting Development&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Architect the logic and infrastructure for our advanced geo-targeting tool, enabling precise audience segmentation based on location intelligence and behavioral data.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Oversee the development of robust data pipelines capable of processing and analyzing vast amounts of location and transaction data securely and efficiently.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop features for closed-loop campaign measurement and attribution, linking off-site ad exposure to online or offline transaction data.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;AdTech &amp;amp; Off-Site Integrations&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead integrations with external AdTech partners, including Supply Side Platforms (SSPs), Demand Side Platforms (DSPs), and Data Management Platforms (DMPs) to facilitate seamless off-site ad delivery.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure compliance with industry standards (e.g., OpenRTB, VAST) while adapting them for specialized location-based and off-site media environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cross-Functional Collaboration &amp;amp; Market Expansion&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner intimately with Sales to understand client needs and define Go-To-Market strategies for new features, ensuring commercial viability.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with Operations to build scalable processes for onboarding, campaign execution, and reporting.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as the primary technical liaison between our engineering team and external partners/brands, especially during international rollouts, translating complex constraints into clear value propositions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Ideal Candidate&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Must-Haves:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Technical Fluency:&lt;/strong&gt; Strong understanding of APIs, cloud architecture, and large-scale data pipelines. You are comfortable discussing JSON payloads one minute and global business strategy the next.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;End-to-End Ownership:&lt;/strong&gt; Proven track record of taking products from 0 to 1, managing the entire lifecycle from discovery to commercial rollout.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Data &amp;amp; AdTech Expertise:&lt;/strong&gt; Proven experience building data products, audience targeting tools, or working extensively within the AdTech ecosystem (DSPs, DMPs, SSPs).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Expansion Mindset:&lt;/strong&gt; Experience or strong interest in scaling products internationally; an understanding of the nuances and privacy landscapes of the US market is highly desirable.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Data-Driven:&lt;/strong&gt; Ability to define success metrics (Match Rates, CPM, ROAS, Incrementality) and use data to prioritize features.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Nice-to-Haves:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with location intelligence or geospatial data analysis.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Background in retail media networks or off-site retail media strategies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with clean room technologies or advanced attribution modeling.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Domain specific expertise is a plus but we will onboard you in case you don’t have it:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience as a Product Manager or Technical Product Manager, with a specific focus on AdTech, MarTech, or Data Platforms.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Retail Media Knowledge:&lt;/strong&gt; Understanding of the Retail Media landscape, specifically how off-site media budgets are allocated and measured.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why You&#39;ll Enjoy Working Here&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role isn’t for everyone - and that’s intentional. We’re building Verve Retail Media from the ground up, reducing legacy structures, places to hide, and “passenger seats”. This is a place for people who want to build, take ownership, and see the direct impact of their work.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You won’t be one of many - you’ll be one of the few shaping how this company grows, decides, and wins. And every role counts - from Office Management to Chief of Staff to this role.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you’re looking for comfort, predictability, or perfectly defined lanes, this probably isn’t your environment. If you’re looking for steep growth, real responsibility, and the chance to work with people who raise your bar - you’ll feel at home here.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;What you can expect:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Real ownership from day one - take decisions, not just tasks&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A steep learning curve - accelerated growth through real responsibility, not theory&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;High-performing peers - work with ambitious, driven people who challenge and support you&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Direct impact - your work will shape products, processes, and outcomes in real time&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Cutting-edge tools - including AI-powered workflows that multiply your output&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Continuous development - training budget, internal learning formats, and language courses&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a place where expectations are high - and so is the opportunity to grow, contribute, and build something meaningful.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Verve provides equal employment opportunities to all employees and applicants for employment and prohibits discrimination and harassment of any type without regard to race, color, religion, age, sex, national origin, disability status, genetics, protected veteran status, sexual orientation, gender identity or expression, or any other characteristic protected by federal, state or local laws.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8pt;&quot;&gt;Verve provides equal employment opportunities to all employees and applicants for employment and prohibits discrimination and harassment of any type without regard to race, color, religion, age, sex, national origin, disability status, genetics, protected veteran status, sexual orientation, gender identity or expression, or any other characteristic protected by federal, state or local laws.&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;If you are a California resident subject to the California Consumer Privacy Act, &lt;a href=&quot;https://verve.com/california-applicant-privacy-notice/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;click here&lt;/a&gt; to understand how Verve processes your personal information and how you can exercise your rights.&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8pt;&quot;&gt;If you are located in the EU or UK visit our&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;a style=&quot;font-size: 8pt;&quot; href=&quot;https://verve.com/applicant-privacy-policy/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;privacy policy&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8pt;&quot;&gt; to understand how Verve processes your personal information and how you can exercise your rights.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Curious Minds. Bold Ideas. Extraordinary Impact&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;We&#39;re transforming financial services through bold innovation and relentless execution. You bring the ideas and drive. We&#39;ll build what&#39;s next — together.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Job Summary&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Project Manager, you will be part of a high-performing professional services team focused on evaluating how the nCino product can best meet our European clients’ needs and working with the Implementation Consultant to oversee the application of a seven-step implementation process with nCino bank and credit union customers.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Execute strategic vision and adoption of nCino across financial institutions by engaging stakeholders at all levels. Foster strong relationships and ensure alignment with organizational goals for project success.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Take full ownership of the project/program timeline, proactively addressing risks and dependencies. Implement strategies to keep deliverables on track and ensure timely completion of milestones.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Leads cross-functional teams using Agile methodologies, ensuring efficient delivery of projects by facilitating sprint planning, daily stand-ups, retrospectives, and ensuring continuous improvement throughout the development lifecycle.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Oversees large-scale implementations by managing multiple workstreams, ensuring alignment across teams, mitigating risks, and maintaining project timelines to deliver successful, integrated solutions on time and within budget&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manages stakeholder relationships by ensuring clear communication, expectations alignment, and regular updates; oversees resource allocation to optimize team performance and capacity; tracks budget and burn rates to ensure projects stay within financial constraints; and monitors key performance indicators (KPIs) and business value metrics (BVMs) to assess progress, drive decision-making, and ensure delivery of high-impact outcomes&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Independently handle project escalations, maintaining momentum and customer satisfaction. Swiftly address challenges and implement effective problem-solving strategies.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exhibit advanced skills in managing nCino project plans and tooling, including task management, resource coordination, and milestone achievement. Ensure alignment with strategic objectives and timely, budget-compliant deliverables.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide comprehensive project status updates and risk assessments to peers and senior management. Ensure transparent communication across all stakeholders, enhancing project visibility and confidence.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Seek knowledge, refine domain skills, and work collaboratively for team success. Foster a culture of continuous learning and professional growth, developing advanced technical skills.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mentor new employees, interact with leaders across departments, and be sought out for opinions on significant matters. Lead by example, driving organizational excellence and contributing to the refinement of internal processes and tools within our teams.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proactively identify and capitalize on whitespace within programs to drive revenue for nCino. This includes assessing additional resourcing needs, exploring cross-sell/up-sell opportunities, and negotiating higher rates based on the value provided by current resources.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Leverage AI tools and techniques to enhance work efficiency and optimize business operations by automating routine tasks to improve accuracy, save time, and minimize errors.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Utilize AI-driven insights to refine decision-making, elevate customer experience, and boost team productivity while ensuring its application provides measurable value, driving innovation and smarter ways of working.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Stay informed on AI advancements to drive continuous learning and scalable growth opportunities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Required:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Undergraduate degree in a relevant field (e.g., Business, Management, Information Technology) or equivalent experience.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;8+ years of professional experience in project management or a related field.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency in Microsoft Office Suite (Word, Excel, PowerPoint).&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven ability to manage complex tasks with precision, leveraging strong organizational, time management, and problem-solving skills.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Communicates effectively across all levels, translating complex information into clear, audience-appropriate messaging.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Successfully leads projects with minimal oversight, demonstrating initiative while appropriately escalating issues when needed.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Builds credibility and influence through transparent communication, collaborative engagement, and consistent follow-through.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Actively supports organizational change by identifying opportunities for improvement and constructively challenging existing processes.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Desired:&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Salesforce experience&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;nCino experience (as an end user or nCino implementation) &amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;PMP/PMI certification preferred&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Position may require travel&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Previous project management experience&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Background in multiple lines of business in banking&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with agile software delivery practices and concepts&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;description&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;The pay range for this role is based on relative market data and alignment with our compensation philosophy. The range displayed reflects the minimum and maximum of the pay range for each job posting, which is used to determine new hire rates/salaries and takes into consideration multiple factors including but not limited to knowledge, skills, abilities, proficiencies, experience, education, &lt;span class=&quot;WGI1&quot;&gt;licensures/certifications,&lt;/span&gt; as well as business and organizational needs. nCino reserves the right to modify the posted range consistent with our internal practices and external market movement. The recruiter for this job posting can share more compensation details during the recruitment process, as base salary is only one component of the total compensation package per position posted.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;The base salary range for this job is:&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;£63,200&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;£107,400 GBP&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;nCino provides equal employment opportunities to all employees and applicants for employment without regard to race, color, religion, sex, sexual orientation, gender identity, national origin, age, protected veteran status, disability, genetics or other protected groups. In addition to federal law requirements, nCino complies with applicable state and local laws governing nondiscrimination in employment in every location in which the company has facilities. This policy applies to all terms and conditions of employment, including recruiting, hiring, placement, promotion, termination, layoff, recall, transfer, leaves of absence, compensation and training.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;nCino is committed to the full inclusion of all qualified individuals. As part of this commitment, nCino will ensure that persons with disabilities are provided reasonable accommodations. If reasonable accommodation is needed to participate in the job application or interview process, to perform essential job functions, and/or to receive other benefits and privileges of employment, please contact us at &lt;a ----- -----
&lt;p&gt;Our commitment to inclusion and equality includes a strong belief that the diversity of our team is instrumental to our success.&amp;nbsp; We strive to create workplaces where employees are empowered to bring their authentic selves to work.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
