&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;[li_&amp;amp;]:mb-0 [li_&amp;amp;]:mt-1 [li_&amp;amp;]:gap-1 [&amp;amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:pb-1 list-disc flex flex-col gap-1 pl-8 mb-3&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Leading Data &amp;amp; AI engagements end-to-end, taking ownership of scope, budget, project governance, client steering, and escalations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Guiding and coordinating Swiss, nearshore, and offshore delivery teams and reviewing their output to ensure quality and alignment with client expectations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contributing hands-on to delivery yourself, from Data &amp;amp; AI advisory and solution architecture to technical design and implementation where it adds the most value.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Working directly with client stakeholders and decision-makers to translate business needs into practical Data &amp;amp; AI solutions across strategy and advisory, data platforms on Databricks (including Xebia AXIS), Agentic Data Foundations, GenAI, and agentic AI, and seeing them through from production into managed services.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identifying and shaping new opportunities within existing client accounts in close collaboration with Account Managers and Sales, and contributing to solution design, proposals, statements of work, effort estimates, staffing plans, and service line initiatives such as offerings, accelerators, and demos.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
